    rdfs:subClassOf obo:PATO_0000150 .

obo:FLOPO_0985015 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "plicate"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A folded quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer being folded back and forth longitudinally like a fan."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "Approved FLOPO botanical concept proposal PATO-CAND:plicate (curation/botanical_concept_proposals.tsv, curator decision accept on 2026-09-18). Provisional FLOPO-local representation of a class proposed to PATO (curation/upstream_drafts/pato-pr-1-botanical-qualities.md); replace it with the PATO identifier via IAO:0100001 once assigned. No PO or PATO identifier is minted locally."@en ;
