    rdfs:subClassOf obo:PO_0025001 .

obo:FLOPO_0985025 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "trunk"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A stem that is the single dominant, persistent, self-supporting main axis of a tree-form plant, extending from ground level and bearing the principal branches."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "Approved FLOPO botanical concept proposal PO-CAND:trunk (curation/botanical_concept_proposals.tsv, curator decision accept_with_revision on 2026-09-18). Provisional FLOPO-local representation of a class proposed to PO (curation/upstream_drafts/po-pr-5-anatomy-classes.md); replace it with the PO identifier via IAO:0100001 once assigned. No PO or PATO identifier is minted locally."@en ;
