        <https://sweetgum.nybg.org/science/glossary/glossary-details/?irn=3106> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf obo:PO_0009025 .

obo:FLOPO_0985028 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "pinnule"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A cardinal organ part that is a secondary or higher-order division of a pinna of a pinnately compound leaf."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "Approved FLOPO botanical concept proposal PO-CAND:pinnule (curation/botanical_concept_proposals.tsv, curator decision accept_with_revision on 2026-09-18). Provisional FLOPO-local representation of a class proposed to PO (curation/upstream_drafts/po-pr-5-anatomy-classes.md); replace it with the PO identifier via IAO:0100001 once assigned. No PO or PATO identifier is minted locally."@en ;
